1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
The clock's hands point...

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:03,500
what time is it?

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,800
This is Clock Master!

4
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:09,340
Read the hands and set the time!

5
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:18,660
Short hand on three, long hand on twelve — that's three o'clock!

6
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:23,840
Short hand on six, long hand on six — that's half past six!

7
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:32,040
Get it right, the clock chimes, and a new time pops up fast!

8
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:40,900
Parents — this builds real-life time-reading, a skill kids use every single day!

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Find it in the app — tap Math Game Zone, pick Clock Master, choose your level, and play!

10
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:54,220
Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
